#: core/manager.cpp:203
#, kde-format
msgid "Current Activity, Threaded"
msgstr "Trenutačna aktivnost, s nitima"

#: core/manager.cpp:204
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This view uses smart date range groups. Messages are threaded. So for "
"example, in \"Today\" you will find all the messages arrived today and all "
"the threads that have been active today."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj prikaz koristi grupe s prilagodljivim datumskim rasponima. Poruke su "
"posložene u niti. Primjerice, u grupi „Danas” pronaći ćete sve poruke koje "
"su danas pristigle i sve niti koje su danas bile aktivne."

#: core/manager.cpp:216
#, kde-format
msgid "Current Activity, Flat"
msgstr "Trenutačna aktivnost, bez niti"

#: core/manager.cpp:217
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This view uses smart date range groups. Messages are not threaded. So for "
"example, in \"Today\" you will simply find all the messages arrived today."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj prikaz koristi grupe s prilagodljivim datumskim rasponima. Poruke nisu "
"posložene u niti. Primjerice, u grupi „Danas” pronaći ćete samo sve poruke "
"koje su danas pristigle."

#: core/manager.cpp:228
#, kde-format
msgid "Activity by Date, Threaded"
msgstr "Aktivnost po datumu, s nitima"

#: core/manager.cpp:229
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This view uses day-by-day groups. Messages are threaded. So for example, in "
"\"Today\" you will find all the messages arrived today and all the threads "
"that have been active today."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj prikaz koristi grupe po danima. Poruke su posložene u niti. Primjerice, "
"u grupi „Danas” pronaći ćete sve poruke koje su danas pristigle i sve niti "
"koje su danas bile aktivne."

#: core/manager.cpp:241
#, kde-format
msgid "Activity by Date, Flat"
msgstr "Aktivnost po datumu, bez niti"

#: core/manager.cpp:242
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This view uses day-by-day groups. Messages are not threaded. So for example, "
"in \"Today\" you will simply find all the messages arrived today."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj prikaz koristi grupe po danima. Poruke nisu posložene u niti. "
"Primjerice, u grupi „Danas” pronaći ćete samo sve poruke koje su danas pristigle."

#: core/manager.cpp:253
#, kde-format
msgid "Standard Mailing List"
msgstr "Standardni popis e-pošte"

#: core/manager.cpp:254
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This is a plain and old mailing list view: no groups and heavy threading."
msgstr "Ovo je jednostavan, klasičan prikaz popisa e-pošte: bez grupa i s puno nizanja poruka."

#: core/manager.cpp:263
#, kde-format
msgid "Flat Date View"
msgstr "Ravni prikaz po datumu"

#: core/manager.cpp:264
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This is a plain and old list of messages sorted by date: no groups and no "
"threading."
msgstr "Ovo je jednostavan, klasičan popis poruka sortiran po datumu: bez grupa i nizanja."

#: core/manager.cpp:275
#, kde-format
msgid "Senders/Receivers, Flat"
msgstr "Pošiljatelji/primatelji, bez niti"

#: core/manager.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This view groups the messages by senders or receivers (depending on the "
"folder type). Messages are not threaded."
msgstr "Ovaj prikaz grupira poruke po pošiljatelju ili primatelju (ovisno o vrsti mape). Poruke nisu posložene u niti."

#: core/manager.cpp:287
#, kde-format
msgid "Thread Starters"
msgstr "Pokretači niti"

#: core/manager.cpp:288
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This view groups the messages in threads and then groups the threads by the "
"starting user."
msgstr "Ovaj prikaz grupira poruke u niti, a zatim niti grupira prema korisniku koji ih je započeo."

